# NOTE: .git is deliberately NOT ignored — hatch-vcs derives the version from the git
# tag during the build stage. A multi-stage build keeps it out of the runtime image.
#
# Only ignore paths git ignores too. Leaving out a tracked path (as .github once was)
# makes the build-stage checkout look modified, and hatch-vcs then stamps the version
# with a date: a v0.1.0 build comes out as 0.1.0.post1.dev0+d20261001.
.venv
__pycache__
*.egg-info
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
*.zarr
